Plan for the regression pass on the plant-timezone date filter (Sofia's PR, landing this week) and the post-#371 export path. Runs Monday and Tuesday next week against the release build, then the Halberd smoke suite on top.

Scope:
1. Date filter: 6 timezone cases (browser vs plant: same, +3h, -8h, DST boundary, UTC plant, custom range persisted across a page refresh)
2. Export: encoding (ASCII only, Latin-1 characters, emoji in notes fields, opened in Excel on Windows and Mac), 1-row, 200k-row, cancelled mid-stream
3. Retry/backoff: one flapping-feed run against staging, just to see it with my own eyes

Out of scope: multi-line ingest (not merged), PDF export (not built).

Severity scale as usual: S1 blocks release, S2 blocks a customer workflow, S3 cosmetic or has a workaround.

Jordan, no sign-off needed; flag anything you want added by Friday.

